OL,3,AFinal inflation figures before the
OL,4,ABudget set to be released
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest UK inflation figures are due
OL,7,Fto be released at 07:00 BST
OL,9,FIt comes ahead of the Budget next week,
OL,10,Fthe first since Andy Burnham became
OL,11,Fprime minister
OL,13,FInflation rose to 3.1% in August, its
OL,14,Fhighest level in five months - today's
OL,15,Ffigures from the Office for National
OL,16,FStatistics (ONS) will cover the 12
OL,17,Fmonths to September
OL,19,FInflation measures the increase in the
OL,20,Fprice of something over time - the Bank
OL,21,Fof England has a target of keeping the
OL,22,Frate at 2%
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
